@startuml

package "Presentation / User Interface" {
  component "Web Management Console" as WebConsole
}

package "Hosting / Distribution" {
  cloud "Web Console Hosting & Distribution" as WebHosting
}

package "API" {
  component "API Gateway REST API\n(stage prod, REGIONAL)" as APIGateway
}

note right of APIGateway
  Exposes API endpoint and API ID (FR-001)
  Request validation for parameters and request bodies (FR-003)
  AWS X-Ray tracing enabled (NFR-003)
  CORS preflight configuration (FR-002/C-002):
  - allowed methods: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS
  - allowed headers: Authorization, Content-Type, X-Amz-Date,
    X-Amz-Security-Token, X-Api-Key
  - statusCode: 200
end note

package "Service / Compute" {
  component "Lambda Service Integrations" as LambdaServices
}

package "Simulation" {
  component "Route Key Resolution" as RouteKeyResolution
  component "Route Loader" as RouteLoader
  component "Route State Assembly / UTF-8 JSON Parsing" as RouteStateAssembly
  component "Device Simulation Engine" as DeviceSimulationEngine
  component "Simulated Message Publisher" as MessagePublisher
}

package "Data / Persistence" {
  database "Amazon S3\n(ROUTE_BUCKET, route JSON)" as S3
  database "Amazon DynamoDB" as DynamoDB
}

note bottom of DynamoDB
  Listed in environment.
  Exact persistence mapping not specified in PRD.
end note

package "Integration / Messaging" {
  cloud "AWS IoT Topics" as IoTTopics
  cloud "AWS Step Functions" as StepFunctions
}

note bottom of StepFunctions
  AWS-managed orchestration service listed in PRD.
end note

package "Identity / Authentication" {
  cloud "Identity & Authentication Services" as IdentityServices
}

package "Deployment / Infrastructure" {
  component "Solution ID / Version Configuration" as SolutionConfig
  component "Custom-Resource Handler" as CustomResourceHandler
  cloud "AWS CloudFormation" as CloudFormation
}

note bottom of CustomResourceHandler
  Custom resource returns response body (FR-004).
end note

cloud "Log Destination" as LogDestination
cloud "AWS Lambda" as AWSLambda

WebHosting --> WebConsole : hosts/distributes
WebConsole --> APIGateway : manages simulations and device types
APIGateway --> LambdaServices : invokes Lambda-backed operations
APIGateway --> LogDestination : JSON access logs / INFO method logs
APIGateway --> IdentityServices : Authorization

LambdaServices --> DeviceSimulationEngine : triggers simulations
DeviceSimulationEngine --> RouteKeyResolution : "resolves routeInfo.routeName or default route-{random route identifier}.json (FR-005/C-003)"
RouteKeyResolution --> RouteLoader : supplies resolved route key
RouteLoader --> S3 : reads route JSON by key
RouteLoader --> RouteStateAssembly : parses UTF-8 JSON and assembles route state/output fields (DR-002/DR-003)
RouteStateAssembly --> DeviceSimulationEngine : provides assembled route state/output fields

DeviceSimulationEngine --> MessagePublisher : emits simulated messages
MessagePublisher --> IoTTopics : publishes to AWS IoT topics

RouteLoader --> DeviceSimulationEngine : propagates S3 retrieval error
DeviceSimulationEngine --> LambdaServices : returns S3 retrieval error
LambdaServices --> APIGateway : returns retrieval error to caller (FR-006)

CloudFormation --> CustomResourceHandler : invokes custom resource with StackName input property (DR-004/C-004)
CustomResourceHandler --> CloudFormation : returns response body (FR-004)
SolutionConfig --> CustomResourceHandler : provides solution ID/version (FR-004/C-004)
CustomResourceHandler ..> AWSLambda : deployed on/as AWS Lambda

@enduml
